  "description": "The Pinnacle Californium a practical and comfortable city bike without the weight of the all-steel alternatives. A wide range of gears and relaxed riding position combine to take you around town with ease and style. Easy to handle and sleek in design, classic without being old-fashioned. The Californium is one of our best-selling models and a true ‘modern classic’.\n\nThe Pinnacle Californium comes complete with mudguards and chain cover so you can keep smiling through the puddles. The practical front basket lets you take a load off your shoulders and the included kickstand means you can park your new pride-and-joy anywhere. Just don't forget your lock!\n\n'The Pinnacle Californium 2 is a great looking bike that also delivers on ride quality with superb handling. It is not only a head turner but a bike you'll love to ride.'- Good Housekeeping\n\n'Not only was the ride incredibly smooth, the Californium handled beautifully. The gears, in particular, were easy to switch around.' - Ice Bike",
